{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/dusit-princess-rijas-development-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":335,"crm_id":"2242","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Dusit Princess","slug":"dusit-princess-rijas-development-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["suites","studio"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Rijas Development","price":691900,"display_price":"691K","lattitude":25.05131624680589,"longitude":55.19922556716641,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":1,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Dusit Princess Rijas is a project by developer Rijas Development, which is located in one of the most popular areas of the city, Jumeirah Village Circle. Dusit Princess Rijas offers luxury exclusive hotel apartments.</p><p>Dusit Princess Rijas has a distinct personality, immersing the guest in Arabian culture. At Dusit Princess Rijas, you will find 224 options ranging from <strong>studios to one-bedroom suites,</strong> which are fully equipped with the latest high-tech amenities and collections of premium-brand kitchenware, appliances.</p><p>Dusit Princess Rijas is an upper end brand in the mid-price segment of the market. It caters to business and leisure travelers who value well-being, tranquility, and quality services. Qualified managers are ready to fulfill any request and ensure an unforgettable experience at Dusit Princess Rijas.</p><p>With extensive expertise in wellness and spa, the complex offers the best facilities for relaxation and meditation. Guests also have access to a gym and swimming pool. The Dusit Princess Rijas also has restaurants and cafes, stores and playgrounds, bars, lounge areas.</p><p>Dusit Princess Rijas has easy access to the key points of the city. Dusit Princess Rijas Apartments are located in the Jumeirah Village Circle area and are well connected to Al Khail Road, Sheikh Mohammed bin Zayed Road. Dubai Marina, Palm Jumeirah, Mall of the Emirates, Al-Maktoum International Airport and Expo 2020 are less than 20 minutes' drive from the complex.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2242/images/2024/06/20/N0b77WAwwwoLsPjpXRnVdksd36vzxGiWQtabkQQP.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/20/N0b77WAwwwoLsPjpXRnVdksd36vzxGiWQtabkQQP.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2242/images/2024/06/20/yOb2CfVknnuolLy1iO4xSV2NyN74h4K6xmjBBEQh.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/20/yOb2CfVknnuolLy1iO4xSV2NyN74h4K6xmjBBEQh.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2242/images/2024/06/20/BIyyBV09EGzZI4HYgGvlyNLSDcHaems8X4JzXfqy.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/20/BIyyBV09EGzZI4HYgGvlyNLSDcHaems8X4JzXfqy.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2242/images/2024/06/20/da0zNMJ45KDSS2THJekdy5w31bu84sLWU0M19ONl.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/20/da0zNMJ45KDSS2THJekdy5w31bu84sLWU0M19ONl.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2925,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/06/19/LB8jCdCKHpe6hABWT7tpGOQh7qrkT2Qs3N5wZOX4.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1544,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":2153,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Suite","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2154,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"Studio","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_tex